{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07885","headline":"送莫甥兼诸昆弟从韩司马入西军 · 孟浩然","name":"送莫甥兼诸昆弟从韩司马入西军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"念尔习诗礼，未曾违户庭。\n平生早偏露，万里更飘零。\n坐弃三牲养，行观八阵形。\n饰装辞故里，谋策赴边庭。\n壮志吞鸿鹄，遥心伴鶺鴒。\n所从文且武，不战自应宁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07885.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07885","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}